This project is a clean-room implementation of the personal-data protection
service described in PLAN_FINAL_MERGED.md. It borrows specific engineering
solutions from the reference project AIAlfa-master (see docs/DECISIONS.md) but
does not copy its source wholesale.

The built-in Russian name dictionary (NameDictionary) is a small hand-curated
list of common first names, patronymics and surname suffixes assembled for this
project. It is not derived from any proprietary dataset.